<h1 style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:21px;">Confirm your email address</h1>
<p style="margin:0 0 12px;">Hi {{name}},</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 12px;">Thanks for signing up for {{appName}}. Confirm your email address to activate your account.</p>
{{> button url=verifyUrl label="Verify email address"}}
<p style="margin:20px 0 0;font-size:13px;color:#64748b;">This link expires in {{expiresIn}}. If you did not create an account, you can ignore this email.</p>
